howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 2
inconsistent false
omitted 1
omission UnresolvedImport(http://example.org/does-not-exist)
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 6
sub http://example.org/t#A http://example.org/t#A
sub http://example.org/t#A http://example.org/t#B
sub http://example.org/t#A http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#B http://example.org/t#B
sub http://example.org/t#B http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
